  "title": "Handoff (exeris-kernel)",
  "description": "The bundle's shape, narrowed to this repository's roles. `blocking` stays required: the difference between a handoff that may proceed in parallel and one that may not is the only thing a receiving role cannot infer.",
  "allOf": [
    {
      "$ref": "../vendor/exeris-agents-1.3.0/schemas/handoff.base.schema.json"
    },
    {
